==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's standard illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Next Destinies|Growlithe|11}} from the {{TCG|Next Destinies}} expansion.
*This card's shiny rare illustration features a {{Shiny}} {{p|Growlithe}}.
*{{m|Bite}} is a [[move]] in the [[Pokémon games]] that {{p|Growlithe}} can learn.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Scarlet}}.

